# 004: GPO Change Request

**Date:** 2026-11-10

## Context
Building 7 GPOs, the plan says one change per GPO (7 changes).

## Options considered
- One change per GPO
- One change with 7 Change Tasks

## Decision
One Normal change, “Group Policy baseline”, with a Change Task per GPO. Still tracks each GPO separately, teaches you Change Tasks, and saves time

## Consequences
-7 separate normal changes is most realistic for a strict company, but about 5 minutes of admin each. Behind schedule, and it’s a genuine ServiceNow feature companies use for multi-part work.